{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再反复盘算该收住还是放开，也不靠克制证明自己清醒，因为收住和尽情投入都不能保证他不受伤。\",\n      \"key\": \"收住还是放开\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道对方有自己的心意，不必和他一样，若要对方接住全部期待，亲近反会失去自在。\",\n      \"key\": \"自己的心意\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想被爱，也还想要更多，却不把自己的渴望当成对方必须满足的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"想被爱\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得小心靠近、慷慨付出、独自珍藏和尽情欢喜，都确实给过他快乐，也让他一次次愿意继续向前。\",\n      \"key\": \"小心靠近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道遗憾不必消失也能好好喜欢，等不到对方主动靠近时仍会疼，却不因疼痛否认感情或催对方回应。\",\n      \"key\": \"遗憾不必消失\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S14-4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d3d89940-c1c4-406d-9fdc-43cb8b858371", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T133129618901Z", "elapsed_seconds": 276.859, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T13:36:06.479762+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "445db96401483b81c4f24e8a32fe63855d7b3198def448c403a629cbeb51ff0f", "attachme